#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"xx-method\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"xx-method\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Transpiler stage and plugin options {#transpiler-stage-and-plugin-options}"
msgstr ""
"Transpiler-Stufen- und Plugin-Optionen {#transpiler-stage-and-plugin-"
"options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These options are suffixed with `_method`. They influence how the transpiler"
" works and are used to try and get better, different, or specific output "
"from the transpiler.\n"
msgstr ""
"Diese Optionen haben das Suffix `_method`. Sie beeinflussen die Arbeitsweise"
" des Transpilers und werden verwendet, um bessere, unterschiedliche oder "
"spezifische Ausgaben vom Transpiler zu erhalten.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`init_method` (str) - The plugin to use for the initialization stage.\n"
msgstr "`init_method` (str) - Das Plugin für die Initialisierungsstufe.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`layout_method` (str) - The layout selection pass (`trivial`, `dense`, "
"`sabre`). This can also be the external plugin name to use for the layout "
"stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`layout_method` (str) - Der Layout-Auswahlpass (`trivial`, `dense`, "
"`sabre`). Dies kann auch der externe Plugin-Name sein, der für die Layout-"
"Stufe verwendet werden soll.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`optimization_method` (str) - The plugin to use for the optimization "
"stage.\n"
msgstr "`optimization_method` (str) - Das Plugin für die Optimierungsstufe.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`routing_method` (str) - Name of routing pass (`basic`, `lookahead`, "
"`default`, `sabre`, `none`). This can also be the external plugin name to "
"use for the routing stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`routing_method` (str) - Name des Routing-Passes (`basic`, `lookahead`, "
"`default`, `sabre`, `none`). Dies kann auch der externe Plugin-Name sein, "
"der für die Routing-Stufe verwendet werden soll.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`scheduling_method` (str) - Name of scheduling pass. This can also be the "
"external plugin name to use for the scheduling stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`scheduling_method` (str) - Name des Scheduling-Passes. Dies kann auch der "
"externe Plugin-Name sein, der für die Scheduling-Stufe verwendet werden "
"soll.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`as_soon_as_possible`: Schedule instructions greedily: as early as possible "
"on a qubit resource (alias: `asap`).\n"
msgstr ""
"`as_soon_as_possible`: Plane Instruktionen gierig: so früh wie möglich auf "
"einer Qubit-Ressource (Alias: `asap`).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`as_late_as_possible`: Schedule instructions late.  That is, keep qubits in "
"the ground state when possible (alias: `alap`).\n"
msgstr ""
"`as_late_as_possible`: Plane Instruktionen spät. Das heißt, halte Qubits im "
"Grundzustand, wenn möglich (Alias: `alap`).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`translation_method` (str) - Name of translation pass (`unroller`, "
"`translator`, `synthesis`). This can also be the external plugin name to use"
" for the translation stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`translation_method` (str) - Name des Übersetzungs-Passes (`unroller`, "
"`translator`, `synthesis`). Dies kann auch der externe Plugin-Name sein, der"
" für die Übersetzungsstufe verwendet werden soll.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`unitary_synthesis_method` (str) - The name of the unitary synthesis method "
"to use. By default `default` is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"`unitary_synthesis_method` (str) - Der Name der Unitär-Synthesemethode. "
"Standardmäßig wird `default` verwendet.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  To see a list of all installed plugins for a given stage, run [`list_stage_plugins(\"stage_name\")`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins). For example, if you want to see a list of all installed plugins for the routing stage, run `list_stage_plugins(routing)`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Um eine Liste aller installierten Plugins für eine bestimmte Stufe zu sehen, führe [`list_stage_plugins(\"stage_name\")`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) aus. Wenn du beispielsweise eine Liste aller installierten Plugins für die Routing-Stufe sehen möchtest, führe `list_stage_plugins(routing)` aus.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

